BugInfo.Description:
程序创建或分配同步锁资源后，对锁并未进行释放，然后又对同步锁进行了获取。当程序对锁释放不完全，将会降低系统性能甚至可能会导致死锁。而当锁释放完全时，内部获取的锁将毫无意义。  

**例如**：下面代码片段中，在代码块中多次调用了`Lock.lock()`方法，程序对锁释放不完全。  
```java
public final class Client {  
    public void doSomething(File file) {  
    final Lock lock = new ReentrantLock();  
    InputStream in = null;  
    lock.lock();  
    ...  
    lock.lock();  
    try {  
        in = new FileInputStream(file);  
        // Perform operations on the open file  
    } catch (FileNotFoundException fnf) {  
        // Forward to handler  
    } finally {  
        if (in != null) {  
            try {  
                in.close();  
            } catch (IOException e) {  
                // Forward to handler  
            }  
        }  
        lock.unlock();  
    }  
}
```  
**例2**：下面代码片段中，释放锁和获取锁一一对应，系统不会抛出异常。但是最外部的锁已经将内部资源全部锁住，内部再获取将毫无意义。  
```java
public final class Client {  
    public void doSomething(File file) {  
    final Lock lock = new ReentrantLock();  
    InputStream in = null;  
    lock.lock();  
    try {  
        in = new FileInputStream(file);  
        // Perform operations on the open file  
        lock.lock();  
        try {  
            ...  
        }finally {  
            lock.unlock();  
        }  
    } catch (FileNotFoundException fnf) {  
        // Forward to handler  
    } finally {  
        if (in != null) {  
            try {  
                in.close();  
            } catch (IOException e) {  
                // Forward to handler  
            }  
        }  
        lock.unlock();  
    }  
}
```

BugInfo.Advice:
检查程序逻辑，保证任何情况下，对程序所需有的锁进行正常获取。  

**例如**：下列代码片段中，在代码块中只调用了一次`Lock.lock()`方法。  
```java
public final class Client {  
    public void doSomething(File file) {  
    final Lock lock = new ReentrantLock();  
    InputStream in = null;  
    lock.lock();  
    try {  
        in = new FileInputStream(file);  
        // Perform operations on the open file  
    } catch (FileNotFoundException fnf) {  
        // Forward to handler  
    } finally {  
        if (in != null) {  
            try {  
                in.close();  
            } catch (IOException e) {  
                // Forward to handler  
            }  
        }  
        lock.unlock();  
    }  
}
```
